  "title": "Chicken in Cream Sauce",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s Salvadoran-style chicken stewed in sour cream is comfort food at its best: succulent, flavorful, and filling, with just the right amount of heat.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
